The first time was
18 months ago,


01:33:34.759 --> 01:33:37.176
just after his diagnosis
of bone cancer.


01:33:39.176 --> 01:33:42.717
He invited us to a party
with a cake saying:


01:33:44.342 --> 01:33:45.717
"Happy Cancer".


01:33:51.509 --> 01:33:54.259
Jean loved dumb jokes.


01:33:58.176 --> 01:34:02.217
Like when he switched
Xavier's phone numbers.


01:34:03.176 --> 01:34:04.759
Xavier's grandmother


01:34:04.926 --> 01:34:08.301
got a message
intended for his lover.


01:34:13.467 --> 01:34:16.217
We laughed less
as he had more chemo.


01:34:19.134 --> 01:34:20.884
One morning I woke,


01:34:23.467 --> 01:34:24.634
he said to me...


01:34:25.759 --> 01:34:27.051
you deserve better.


01:34:29.342 --> 01:34:31.051
And he disappeared.


01:34:34.759 --> 01:34:36.426
I really hated you for that.


01:34:38.717 --> 01:34:40.134
Then I understood that,


01:34:41.092 --> 01:34:42.384
your extreme freedom


01:34:43.259 --> 01:34:44.717
was your way of fighting,


01:34:46.009 --> 01:34:47.592
of hiding the pain.


01:34:49.926 --> 01:34:52.426
Like building this team,
the Shiny Shrimps.


01:34:54.467 --> 01:34:57.009
To show your Dad that
homos can play water-polo.


01:35:00.342 --> 01:35:01.301
Jean...


01:35:02.051 --> 01:35:03.342
Love of my life.


01:35:05.801 --> 01:35:07.717
You would have
hated your funeral.


01:35:09.426 --> 01:35:10.842
All in black,


01:35:11.676 --> 01:35:13.051
all so sad.


01:35:18.551 --> 01:35:20.634
I hope you're watching.


01:35:21.801 --> 01:35:23.176
Because this is for you.


01:35:25.384 --> 01:35:26.301
Friends...


01:35:38.384 --> 01:35:40.592
- What are they doing?
- I don't know.


01:37:21.301 --> 01:37:23.217
These people have
no respect, huh?


01:37:24.759 --> 01:37:25.676
Fuck off.


01:37:26.426 --> 01:37:28.384
Hey that's not on!


01:37:29.926 --> 01:37:32.092
You can keep your invite.
I'm not going.


01:38:38.634 --> 01:38:44.634
This film is dedicated to
the real Shiny Shrimps.

